42:23.000 --> 42:26.000
O bha similear, bha similear, bha ‘luidhear’.

42:26.000 --> 42:33.000
’S e bha bitheanta de ‘chuilbh’. Bhiodh e air a’ …

42:34.000 --> 42:39.000
