56:09.000 --> 56:14.000
Bha meall an àiteachan, ’s ann le spaid a bha iad …

56:14.000 --> 56:16.000
Leis an spaid …Cha robh ‘cas-chrom’ no cas …?

56:16.000 --> 56:18.000
Cha robh a’ ‘chas-chrom’. Cha robh.

56:19.000 --> 56:23.000
’S e ‘cas-chas’ a their sinne ris a’ ‘chas-chrom’ an rathad againne.

56:25.000 --> 56:27.000
Aidh.

56:28.000 --> 56:31.000
’S e ‘cas-chrom’ a bheireadh iad againne ach cha robh i ann.

56:31.000 --> 56:36.000
Cha robh i ann rim latha-sa. Cha robh a’ ‘chas-chrom’ ann rim latha-sa idir.

56:36.000 --> 56:38.000
Tha i againne fhathast.

56:43.000 --> 56:45.000
Dè seo a’ stobadh a’ bhuntàta.

56:45.000 --> 56:46.000
