01:00:42.000 --> 01:00:43.000
A-nise,

01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:47.000
dè an dòigh air am biodh iad a’ dèanamh ìm?

01:00:47.000 --> 01:00:48.000
Dè theireadh iad ris an sin?

01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:49.000
O ’s e a’ ‘chrannachan’.

01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:50.000
‘Crannachan’.

01:00:50.000 --> 01:00:51.000
‘Crannachan’, [‘curn’/?].

01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:55.000
Uill, bha meall ’s e [‘curn’/?] a bheireadh iad mu dheireadh.

01:00:55.000 --> 01:01:00.000
Cha robh sin ach dìreach a’ Bheurla car … ’S e an ‘crannachan’ … [‘Muidh’/?]

01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:03.000
’S e [muidh/?] a theireadh sinne.

01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:04.000
[Muidh/?], crannachan.

01:01:06.000 --> 01:01:09.000
’S e an crannachan, tha mi smaoineachadh, bu trice a bha …

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:13.000
Dè seòrsa uidheam a bha sin? An e …?

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:14.000
Fear-loinig.

01:01:14.000 --> 01:01:15.000
Seadh.

01:01:15.000 --> 01:01:16.000
’S e.

01:01:18.000 --> 01:01:21.000
Fear-loinig a bh’ air ùisneachadh.

01:01:22.000 --> 01:01:27.000
’S a’ mhòr-chuid gu mu dheireadh dh’fhaodte gum biodh [XX]-loinig …

01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:34.000
