01:01:47.000 --> 01:01:55.000
[...]

01:01:57.000 --> 01:02:03.000
Dè theireadh sibh ris a’ bhainne a thigeadh on bhò an dèidh dhi breith?

01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:04.000
Bainne-buidhe.

01:02:08.000 --> 01:02:10.000
Am biodh sibh ga [XX]?

01:02:10.000 --> 01:02:13.000
Bhitheadh. Bhitheadh.

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:16.000
Bainne-buidhe a theireadh sibh ris? Bainne-buidhe?

01:02:16.000 --> 01:02:17.000
Bainne-buidhe.

01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:21.000
Ciad-bhainne.
Ciad-bhainne.

01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:23.000
Bha ciad-bhainne, bainne-buidhe.

01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:33.000
Bhiodh iad ga bhruich ceart gu leòr.

01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:42.000
Tha fhios gum biodh iad a’ dèanamh maragan,

01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:44.000
nuair a bhiodh iad a’ marbhadh beathach caorach.

01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:45.000
Bha. Bha.

01:02:46.000 --> 01:02:51.000
An robh ainmean agaibh air na maragan ’s air an [XX]?

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:54.000
O uill …

01:02:57.000 --> 01:03:03.000
chan eil mi smaoineachadh gun robh, ach ‘marag-dhubh’ is ‘marag-gheal’.

01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:07.000
Tha ainmean againn orra.

01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:14.000
Bha tè mhòr ann mar gum biodh filleachan timcheall oirre.

01:03:14.000 --> 01:03:15.000
O ‘currac-an-rìgh’.

01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:18.000
Seadh. ’S e. An tè mhòr eile…

01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:20.000
an tè mhòr gharbh eile … a bheil cuimhn’ agaibh?

01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:23.000
[Maodal/?]. Chan i. Caolan.

01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:28.000
Tè mhòr mar gum biodh dà bholg mhòr oirre.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:33.000
’S e a’ mhaodal a bhiodh an sin, nach i? ’S e.

01:03:36.000 --> 01:03:38.000
A’ chearc a their sinne rithe.

01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:40.000
A’ chearc, a their sinne rithe.

01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:47.000
Ach … ‘currac-an-rìgh’

01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:52.000
Bha fear eile ann cuideachd,

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:54.000
