01:03:54.000 --> 01:03:56.000
‘Marag [XX] dùinte.’

01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:59.000
Sin agad e. ‘Marag [XX] dùinte’.

01:04:08.000 --> 01:04:10.000
An e ‘minig’ a bheireadh sibh ri stamag?

01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:11.000
Dè?

01:04:11.000 --> 01:04:16.000
An e ‘minig’ a bheireadh sibh ri stamag uain no …?

01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:18.000
Chan e

01:04:19.000 --> 01:04:24.000
A bheil iad a’ dèanamh ‘deasgainn’?

01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:28.000
Feumaidh gum bitheadh.

01:04:32.000 --> 01:04:34.000
‘Deasgainn’. ’S e sin “rennet”.

01:04:34.000 --> 01:04:36.000
‘Binig’?
‘Minig’

01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:39.000
O ‘minig’ a theireadh sibhse. ‘Binig’ a theirinn-sa.

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:42.000
Uill, cha bhi ann ach an aon …

01:04:46.000 --> 01:04:54.000
Fhios agad an seann ghuidh nam biodh tu fhios agad …

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:58.000
nach cuireadh tu droch shùil air beathach,

01:04:58.000 --> 01:05:02.000
‘Do shùil bhiorach ann am binig hama’ …

01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:09.000
’s theireadh feadhainn eile,

01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:10.000
‘Fliuch do shùil’

01:05:14.000 --> 01:05:18.000
nan gonadh tu beathach. 

01:05:20.000 --> 01:05:36.000
[...]

01:05:38.000 --> 01:05:45.000
‘Slabhag’ air a ràdh air a’ chuid a bha ’n adharc air.

01:05:45.000 --> 01:05:46.000
O ’s e

01:05:46.000 --> 01:05:52.000
‘Slabhag’. Agus ‘corc-chluasach’,

01:05:56.000 --> 01:05:59.000
beathach a bhiodh cluasan …

01:05:59.000 --> 01:06:02.000
dè mar a bha iad? Bha iad car tiugh is car …

01:06:05.000 --> 01:06:09.000
[XX] … ‘corc-chluasach’.

01:06:11.000 --> 01:06:30.000
[...]

01:06:33.000 --> 01:06:34.000
’S tha fhios gur e ‘searrach’ a bhiodh agaibh is ‘loth’


01:06:34.000 --> 01:06:38.000
is [biorraich/?], [biorraich/?] is loth.

01:06:39.000 --> 01:06:34.000
Dè bh’ anns a’ ‘[bhiorraich/?]’?

01:06:43.000 --> 01:06:47.000
Tha mi smaoineachadh gur e … Bliadhnach a bh’ anns a’ [bhiorraich/?].

01:06:47.000 --> 01:06:51.000
Nam biodh e aige bliadhna is dà bhliadhna, am ‘[biorraich]’.

01:06:51.000 --> 01:06:56.000
Ach gu … cha robh ‘loth’ air [XX] … ‘loth’ aca an Uibhist,

01:06:56.000 --> 01:07:00.000
ach tha mi smaoineachadh gun robh ‘loth’ a’ ciallachadh …

01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:09.000
’s ann boireann a bha an ‘loth’, ach ’s e ‘[biorraich/?’] a theireamaide ris gus bliadhnach,

01:07:09.000 --> 01:07:12.000
no ma dh’fhaodte gun robh e tuilleadh,

01:07:12.000 --> 01:07:16.000
chan eil fhios agam, tha mi smaoineachadh gun robh e na ‘loth’ no nach do …

01:07:17.000 --> 01:07:20.000
na ‘[bhiorraich/?] is e na ‘loth’ [XX] idir

01:07:23.000 --> 01:07:37.000
[...]

01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:47.000
‘S e [‘atharla’/?] bheireadh sibh tha fhios ri mart ri ciad laogh.

01:07:47.000 --> 01:07:48.000
Dè theireadh sibh?

01:07:48.000 --> 01:07:50.000
[‘Atharla/?’]
[‘Atharla/?’]?

01:07:51.000 --> 01:07:55.000
’S e. Agh tha fhios agad, ach dh’fhaodadh an t-agh a bhith gun laogh idir.

01:07:55.000 --> 01:07:56.000
Dh’fhaodadh.

01:07:56.000 --> 01:08:02.000
Ach tè na ciad laogh, ’s e [‘atharla/?’] a bhiodh innte.

01:08:03.000 --> 01:08:10.000
Dè theireadh sibh ri mart can nam biodh i seasg bliadhna … gun laogh ...?

01:08:11.000 -->  01:08:12.000
Uill, [‘geatharnach’/?] /[‘Gaidhearnach’/?]..

01:08:12.000 -->  01:08:13.000
[‘Geatharnach’/?]/[‘Gaidhearnach’/?].

01:08:14.000 --> 01:08:16.000
[‘Geatharnach’/?] /[‘Gaidhearnach’/?].

01:08:16.000 --> 01:08:19.000
Bha i sin gun laogh innte.

01:08:19.000 --> 01:08:23.000
Bha i [‘geatharnach’/?] /[‘gaidhearnach’/?].

01:08:28.000 --> 01:08:30.000
Bha i seasg.

01:08:32.000 --> 01:08:35.000
Uill tha, nam biodh i ma dh’fhaodte …

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:44.000
nam biodh i seasg airson bliadhna no ma bha i seasg dà bhliadhna na …

01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:50.000
[...]

01:08:52.000 --> 01:08:56.000
’S e ‘òigeach’ a bheirinn-sa ri ‘stalan’.

01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:58.000
‘Àigeach’ a th’ againne.
’S e. 

01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:08.000
A-nise, dè th’ anns a’ ‘bhuna-bhuachaille’?

01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:11.000
An e a’ ‘bhuna-bhuachille’ ’s an t-amhsan,

01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:14.000
