01:09:15.000 --> 01:09:17.000
Chan eil fhios a’m cò ris a their sibh …

01:09:19.000 --> 01:09:23.000
’S e an t-‘amhsan’, ’s e sin ‘gannet’.

01:09:23.000 --> 01:09:25.000
An e sin a theireadh sibhse rithe?

01:09:25.000 --> 01:09:27.000
Cha ’reid mi nach e. An t-‘amhsan’.

01:09:27.000 --> 01:09:33.000
Ach chan eil fhios a’m co dhiù ’s e am
[buna-bhuachaille/?] an e aon rud a th’ ann gus nach e.

01:09:33.000 --> 01:09:38.000
Nach e an ‘Great northern diver’ as trice ris an can iad a’ bhuna-bhuachaille.

01:09:38.000 --> 01:09:41.000
‘Buna-bhuachaille’. ’S e sin an ‘Great northern diver’.

01:09:41.000 --> 01:09:42.000
Sùlaire a their sinne.

01:09:42.000 --> 01:09:45.000
‘Sùlaire’. ’S e ‘sùlaire’ a bheir sinne ris cuideachd.

01:09:45.000 --> 01:09:50.000
Cha ’reid mi nach e, nach e ‘sùlaire’ an t-‘amhsan’ cuideachd.

01:09:50.000 --> 01:09:51.000
Seadh

01:09:58.000 --> 01:10:01.000
‘Crann-lach’.

01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:03.000
‘Tunnag’.

01:10:03.000 --> 01:10:06.000
Chan eil i ach beag seach càch.

01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:09.000
Chan eil fhios a’m dè a’ Bheurla a th’ oirre.

01:10:09.000 --> 01:10:13.000
’S e an ‘teal’ a th’ anns an ‘lach’.

01:10:13.000 --> 01:10:14.000
‘Crann-lach’

01:10:14.000 --> 01:10:15.000
‘Crann-lach’. 

01:10:15.000 --> 01:10:17.000
Chan eil i ach beag.

01:10:17.000 --> 01:10:21.000
Chan eil fhios a’m dè a’ Bheurla a th’ oirre.

