01:11:32.000 --> 01:11:33.000
Budagoc

01:11:35.000 --> 01:11:38.000
‘Croman-lòin’ a their sinne ris.

01:11:38.000 --> 01:11:39.000
‘Naosg’.

01:11:40.000 --> 01:11:44.000
‘Croman-lòin’ cha ’reid mi bheir sinne ris.

01:11:44.000 --> 01:11:46.000
’S e an ‘croman-lòin’.

01:11:46.000 --> 01:11:50.000
Bha e aca ann an Àrasaig ’s na h-àiteachan sin am ‘budagoc’ ris.

01:11:51.000 --> 01:11:54.000
’S e ’n ‘croman-lòin’ …

01:11:56.000 --> 01:12:04.000
[...]

