01:14:18.000 --> 01:14:19.000
‘Fath’

01:14:19.000 --> 01:14:21.000
Am ‘fath-thalmhainn’.

01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:27.000
Fath … thalmhainn.

01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:31.000
