01:14:31.000 --> 01:14:32.000
O, an e?

01:14:33.000 --> 01:14:35.000
’S e. An ‘dubh-reabh’

01:14:37.000 --> 01:14:40.000
[...]

01:14:42.000 --> 01:14:48.000
Dè theireadh sibh ris na luchainn a gheibhte a-muigh, no measg an fheòir?

01:14:48.000 --> 01:14:51.000
Cha chuala mise ach na ‘luchainn-feòir’ fhèin.

01:14:51.000 --> 01:14:52.000
Luchainn-feòir.

