01:15:23.000 --> 01:15:27.000
Bha feadhainn a’ cur ‘d’ ann ’s feadhainn nach robh, ach an ‘i’.

01:15:29.000 --> 01:15:31.000
‘Ialtag’.

01:15:36.000 --> 01:15:38.000
“Wasp”. Dè theireadh sibh ri “wasp”?

01:15:38.000 --> 01:15:39.000
