01:15:43.000 --> 01:15:44.000
‘Wasp’.

01:15:46.000 --> 01:15:50.000
[...]

01:15:53.000 --> 01:15:54.000
A’ Ghàidhlig air …?

01:15:54.000 --> 01:15:55.000
