‘Speach’ their feadhainn, ach ‘coimhspeach’ (connspeach) a bhiodh againne.

01:16:07.000 --> 01:16:08.000
‘Coimhspeach’(connspeach). 

01:16:13.000 --> 01:16:15.000
‘Seillean-ruadh’.

01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:16.000
Seadh.

