01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:30.000
Cha chuala mi ach ‘seillean na tòine mòra’.

01:16:33.000 --> 01:16:35.000
‘Seillean-ruadh’.

01:16:37.000 --> 01:16:38.000
‘Seangan-ruadh’.

01:16:38.000 --> 01:16:40.000
